    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "everything just feels... hollow lately. like i'm not even a person anymore, just a series of inputs and outputs. i look at my hands and they don't feel real, like i'm just staring at high-res textures in a game that's lagging. everything's so mediated by screens and data that i feel like a glitch in the system. just a mistake that shouldn't have been compiled.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
